abstract: >-
  Workbooks for a traceable Threat-to-Control-to-Tool mapping for agentic AI
  security: published threat-to-control relationships, 72 derived technical
  requirements, and the documented capabilities of 21 open-source security
  tools, with architectural-layer classifications and coverage analyses.
